<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ER MPH Nurse Note - โรงพยาบาลเมืองปาน</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS สำหรับความสวยงาม สดใส ใช้งานง่าย -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <!-- Google Fonts & FontAwesome Icons -->
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sarabun:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; }
        .gradient-header { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7 0%, #06b6d4 100%); }
        .section-card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-left: 5px solid #0284c7; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="p-2 md:p-4">

    <!-- App Header & Logo -->
    <header class="gradient-header text-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-md mb-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-full text-sky-600 text-3xl shadow-inner animate-pulse">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-house-medical-circle-exclamation text-red-500"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold tracking-wide">ER MPH Nurse Note</h1>
                <p class="text-sm opacity-90 text-yellow-200 font-semibold">โรงพยาบาลเมืองปาน จังหวัดลำปาง</p>
                <p class="text-xs opacity-75">By Bunchai Juntama ENP 2026</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 md:mt-0 text-right text-xs md:text-sm bg-black/20 p-2 rounded-lg">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-hospital-user"></i> Emergency Room Unit | 2026
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4">
        
        <!-- LEFT COLUMN: INPUT FORMS (7 Columns) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4">
            
            <!-- 1. Patient Info & Visit -->
            <div class="section-card p-4 border-l-cyan-500">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-700 mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i> ข้อมูลผู้ป่วยและสถานะการเข้าตรวจ</h3>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-2">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600">📋 HN</label>
                        <input type="text" id="hn" class="w-full p-1.5 border border-cyan-300 rounded focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-400 outline-none" placeholder="ระบุ HN">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600">👥 อายุ (ปี)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="age" class="w-full p-1.5 border border-cyan-300 rounded focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-400 outline-none" placeholder="ระบุอายุ">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600">👩‍❤️‍👨 เพศ</label>
                        <select id="gender" class="w-full p-1.5 border border-cyan-300 rounded focus:ring-1 focus:ring-cyan-400 outline-none">
                            <option value="ชาย">ชาย</option>
                            <option value="หญิง">หญิง</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600">📆 วันที่</label>
                        <div class="flex gap-1">
                            <input type="date" id="visit_date" class="w-full p-1 border border-cyan-300 text-xs rounded">
                            <button onclick="setToday('visit_date')" class="bg-cyan-500 text-white px-1.5 rounded text-[11px] hover:bg-cyan-600">Today</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600">🏥 Visit ER เวลา</label>
                        <div class="flex gap-1">
                            <input type="time" id="visit_time" class="w-full p-1 border border-cyan-300 text-xs rounded">
                            <button onclick="setNow('visit_time')" class="bg-cyan-500 text-white px-1.5 rounded text-[11px] hover:bg-cyan-600">Now</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-gray-600">📝 เวรปฏิบัติงาน</label>
                        <select id="shift" class="w-full p-1.5 border border-cyan-300 rounded text-xs">
                            <option value="เช้า">เช้า</option>
                            <option value="บ่าย">บ่าย</option>
                            <option value="ดึก">ดึก</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button onclick="logGeneralInfo()" class="mt-2 w-full bg-cyan-600 text-white py-1 rounded font-bold hover:bg-cyan-700 text-xs shadow-sm">ส่งข้อมูลผู้ป่วยเข้า Summary</button>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. Vital Signs, SIRS, NEWS2 -->
            <div class="section-card p-4 border-l-orange-500 bg-orange-50/20">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                    <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-orange-700"><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high"></i> 📊 First ER Triage & Vital Signs</h3>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 items-center">
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold">เวลา:</span>
                        <input type="time" id="vst_time" class="p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs w-20">
                        <button onclick="setNow('vst_time')" class="bg-orange-500 text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">Now</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-1.5 mb-2">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">BT (°C)</label>
                        <input type="number" step="0.1" id="vs_bt" oninput="calculateScores()" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs" placeholder="36.5">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">RR (/min)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="vs_rr" oninput="calculateScores()" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs" placeholder="20">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">HR (/min)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="vs_hr" oninput="calculateScores()" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs" placeholder="80">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">BP (mmHg)</label>
                        <input type="text" id="vs_bp" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs" placeholder="120/80">
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">SpO2 (%)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="vs_spo2" oninput="calculateScores()" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs" placeholder="98">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 mb-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">ความต้องการใช้ออกซิเจน</label>
                        <select id="vs_o2_req" onchange="calculateScores()" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs">
                            <option value="ไม่ใช้">ไม่ใช้ (Room Air)</option>
                            <option value="ใช้">ใช้ Oxygen Supplement</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">ระดับความรู้สึกตัว (AVPU)</label>
                        <select id="vs_avpu" onchange="calculateScores()" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs">
                            <option value="A">A</option><option value="V">V</option><option value="P">P</option><option value="U">U</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-600">WBC (เซลล์/ลบ.มม.)</label>
                        <input type="number" id="vs_wbc" oninput="calculateScores()" class="w-full p-1 border border-orange-300 rounded text-xs" placeholder="ถ้ามี">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Score Display -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 bg-white p-2 rounded-lg border border-orange-200 mb-2 shadow-inner">
                    <div class="text-center bg-red-50 p-1 rounded">
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-red-700 block">SIRS Score</span>
                        <span id="sirs_score" class="text-xl font-black text-red-600">0</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-center bg-purple-50 p-1 rounded">
                        <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-purple-700 block">NEWS2 Score</span>
                        <span id="news2_score" class="text-xl font-black text-purple-600">0</span>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Actions -->
                <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <button onclick="logVitalSigns()" class="flex-1 bg-orange-600 text-white py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-orange-700 shadow-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-floppy-disk"></i> บันทึกใน Note Summary</button>
                    <button onclick="clearForm('vital-signs')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-gray-500">Clear</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. Triage & Assessment -->
            <div class="section-card p-4 border-l-emerald-500 bg-emerald-50/10 space-y-2">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-stethoscope"></i> Triage & Assessment การประเมินแรกรับ</h3>
                
                <!-- Nurse Triage -->
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-emerald-200">
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 mb-1">👩🏼‍⚕️ Nurse Triage</label>
                    <div class="flex gap-1.5 items-center">
                        <input type="text" id="nurse_triage_detail" class="flex-1 p-1 border rounded text-xs" placeholder="ระบุผลการคัดกรอง...">
                        <input type="time" id="nt_time" class="p-1 border rounded text-xs w-20">
                        <button onclick="setNow('nt_time')" class="bg-emerald-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logNurseTriage()" class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-bold">บันทึก</button>
                        <button onclick="clearSingleField('nurse_triage_detail')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1.5 py-1 rounded text-xs"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Level Triage -->
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-emerald-200">
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 mb-1">🆘 Level Triage (ESI)</label>
                    <div class="flex gap-1.5 items-center">
                        <select id="esi_level" class="p-1 border rounded text-xs flex-1">
                            <option value="ESI 1">ESI 1 (Resuscitation)</option>
                            <option value="ESI 2">ESI 2 (Emergent)</option>
                            <option value="ESI 3">ESI 3 (Urgent)</option>
                            <option value="ESI 4">ESI 4 (Less Urgent)</option>
                            <option value="ESI 5">ESI 5 (Non-Urgent)</option>
                        </select>
                        <input type="time" id="esi_time" class="p-1 border rounded text-xs w-20">
                        <button onclick="setNow('esi_time')" class="bg-emerald-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logESI()" class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-bold">บันทึก</button>
                        <button onclick="clearSingleField('esi_level')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1.5 py-1 rounded text-xs"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Primary Survey -->
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-emerald-200 space-y-1.5">
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800">🚨 Primary survey</label>
                    
                    <!-- Airway -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center bg-slate-50 p-1 rounded text-xs">
                        <span class="w-16 font-bold">1.) Airway:</span>
                        <select id="ps_airway" class="p-0.5 border rounded"><option value="Pass">Pass</option><option value="Not pass">Not pass</option></select>
                        <input type="text" id="ps_airway_note" class="flex-1 p-0.5 border rounded" placeholder="ระบุอาการ...">
                        <input type="time" id="ps_airway_time" class="w-16 p-0.5 border rounded">
                        <button onclick="setNow('ps_airway_time')" class="bg-emerald-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logPrimarySurvey('Airway','ps_airway','ps_airway_note','ps_airway_time')" class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px]">บันทึก</button>
                        <button onclick="clearPrimaryFields('ps_airway','ps_airway_note','ps_airway_time')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Breathing -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center bg-slate-50 p-1 rounded text-xs">
                        <span class="w-16 font-bold">2.) Breathing:</span>
                        <select id="ps_breathing" class="p-0.5 border rounded"><option value="Pass">Pass</option><option value="Not pass">Not pass</option></select>
                        <input type="text" id="ps_breathing_note" class="flex-1 p-0.5 border rounded" placeholder="ระบุอาการ...">
                        <input type="time" id="ps_breathing_time" class="w-16 p-0.5 border rounded">
                        <button onclick="setNow('ps_breathing_time')" class="bg-emerald-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logPrimarySurvey('Breathing','ps_breathing','ps_breathing_note','ps_breathing_time')" class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px]">บันทึก</button>
                        <button onclick="clearPrimaryFields('ps_breathing','ps_breathing_note','ps_breathing_time')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Circulation -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center bg-slate-50 p-1 rounded text-xs">
                        <span class="w-16 font-bold">3.) Circul:</span>
                        <select id="ps_circulation" class="p-0.5 border rounded"><option value="Pass">Pass</option><option value="Not pass">Not pass</option></select>
                        <input type="text" id="ps_circulation_note" class="flex-1 p-0.5 border rounded" placeholder="ระบุอาการ...">
                        <input type="time" id="ps_circulation_time" class="w-16 p-0.5 border rounded">
                        <button onclick="setNow('ps_circulation_time')" class="bg-emerald-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logPrimarySurvey('Circulation','ps_circulation','ps_circulation_note','ps_circulation_time')" class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px]">บันทึก</button>
                        <button onclick="clearPrimaryFields('ps_circulation','ps_circulation_note','ps_circulation_time')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Disability -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center bg-slate-50 p-1 rounded text-xs">
                        <span class="w-16 font-bold">4.) Disabil:</span>
                        <select id="ps_disability" class="p-0.5 border rounded"><option value="Pass">Pass</option><option value="Not pass">Not pass</option></select>
                        <input type="text" id="ps_disability_note" class="flex-1 p-0.5 border rounded" placeholder="ระบุอาการ...">
                        <input type="time" id="ps_disability_time" class="w-16 p-0.5 border rounded">
                        <button onclick="setNow('ps_disability_time')" class="bg-emerald-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logPrimarySurvey('Disability','ps_disability','ps_disability_note','ps_disability_time')" class="bg-emerald-600 text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px]">บันทึก</button>
                        <button onclick="clearPrimaryFields('ps_disability','ps_disability_note','ps_disability_time')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Alert Fast Track -->
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center bg-amber-100 p-2 rounded border border-amber-300 text-xs">
                    <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">🚑 Alert Fast Track RRT protocol</span>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 items-center">
                        <select id="fast_track_status" class="p-0.5 border rounded"><option value="No">No</option><option value="Yes">Yes</option></select>
                        <input type="time" id="ft_time" class="w-16 p-0.5 border rounded">
                        <button onclick="setNow('ft_time')" class="bg-amber-600 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logFastTrack()" class="bg-amber-700 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">บันทึก</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. Physician Evaluation & Airway Management -->
            <div class="section-card p-4 border-l-indigo-500 bg-indigo-50/10 space-y-2">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-indigo-700"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-md"></i> การประเมินและหัตถการระบบทางเดินหายใจ</h3>
                
                <!-- แพทย์ ER ประเมินอาการ -->
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-indigo-200">
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-indigo-800 mb-1">🏪 แพทย์ ER ประเมินอาการ (ระบุชื่อแพทย์)</label>
                    <div class="flex gap-1.5 items-center">
                        <input type="text" id="doc_name" class="flex-1 p-1 border rounded text-xs" placeholder="ชื่อแพทย์ผู้ตรวจ...">
                        <input type="time" id="doc_eval_time" class="p-1 border rounded text-xs w-20">
                        <button onclick="setNow('doc_eval_time')" class="bg-indigo-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logDocEval()" class="bg-indigo-600 text-white px-2 py-1 rounded text-xs font-bold">บันทึก</button>
                        <button onclick="clearSingleField('doc_name')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1.5 py-1 rounded text-xs"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- แพทย์วินิจฉัยให้การรักษา -->
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-indigo-200 flex justify-between items-center text-xs">
                    <span class="font-bold text-indigo-800">🧑🏻‍⚕️ แพทย์วินิจฉัยให้การรักษา</span>
                    <div class="flex gap-1 items-center">
                        <input type="time" id="doc_treatment_time" class="p-0.5 border rounded w-20">
                        <button onclick="setNow('doc_treatment_time')" class="bg-indigo-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                        <button onclick="logDocTreatment()" class="bg-indigo-600 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">บันทึก</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Oxygen Supplement -->
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-indigo-200 space-y-1.5">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold block text-indigo-800">🌡️ Oxygen supplement</span>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-1 text-xs">
                        <select id="o2_supp_use" class="p-1 border rounded"><option value="No">No</option><option value="Yes">Yes</option></select>
                        <select id="o2_supp_device" class="p-1 border rounded">
                            <option value="Cannula">Cannula</option><option value="Mask with bag">Mask with bag</option><option value="BVM">BVM</option><option value="ETT">ETT</option>
                        </select>
                        <input type="number" id="o2_flow" class="p-1 border rounded" placeholder="Flow (lpm)">
                        <input type="time" id="o2_time" class="p-1 border rounded">
                        <button onclick="setNow('o2_time')" class="bg-indigo-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="logO2Supplement()" class="w-full bg-indigo-600 text-white py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold">บันทึก Oxygen Supp</button>
                </div>

                <!-- Intubation ET Tube -->
                <div class="bg-white p-2 rounded border border-indigo-200 space-y-1.5">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold block text-red-800">🚨 Intubation ET tube</span>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-5 gap-1 text-xs">
                        <select id="ett_use" class="p-1 border rounded"><option value="No">No</option><option value="Yes">Yes</option></select>
                        <input type="text" id="ett_no" class="p-1 border rounded" placeholder="No. ท่อ">
                        <input type="number" id="ett_depth" class="p-1 border rounded" placeholder="ลึก (Depth cms)">
                        <input type="time" id="ett_time" class="p-1 border rounded">
                        <button onclick="setNow('ett_time')" class="bg-indigo-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex gap-2">
                        <button onclick="logIntubation()" class="flex-1 bg-red-600 text-white py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-bold">บันทึก Intubation</button>
                        <button onclick="clearIntubation()" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs">Clear</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 5. Investigations -->
            <div class="section-card p-4 border-l-blue-500 bg-blue-50/10 space-y-2">
                <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-blue-700"><i class="fa-solid fa-vials"></i> ผลการส่งตรวจแล็บและรังสีวินิจฉัย (Investigations)</h3>
                
                <!-- Investigation Lab -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center bg-white p-1.5 rounded border border-blue-200 text-xs">
                    <span class="w-24 font-bold">🧪 Lab ระบุ:</span>
                    <input type="text" id="lab_detail" class="flex-1 p-1 border rounded" placeholder="เช่น CBC, Electrolyte...">
                    <input type="time" id="lab_time" class="w-16 p-1 border rounded">
                    <button onclick="setNow('lab_time')" class="bg-blue-500 text-white px-1 rounded text-[10px]">Now</button>
                    <button onclick="logLab()" class="bg-blue-600 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">บันทึก</button>
                    <button onclick="clearSingleField('lab_detail')" class="bg-gray-400 text-white px-1 rounded"><i class="fa-solid fa-eraser"></i></button>
                </div>

                <!-- DTX stat -->
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 items-center bg-white p-1.5 rounded border border-blue-200 text-xs">
                    <span class="w-24 font-bold">🩸 DTX stat:</span>
